Subject: [PATCH 11/16] Add "generate release notes with agent" to the
 draft-release dialog

The Draft a new release dialog gains a second generator alongside the
deterministic "Generate release notes" button: a "Generate release notes
with agent" button plus an agent picker (Codex / OpenAI API / Claude API /
Claude Code, seeded to the saved default agent).

It feeds the same commit range the deterministic generator uses to the
chosen provider and asks for grouped, GitHub-style Markdown notes, then
drops the result into the Notes box. The reply is guarded with QPointer
since it can land after the modal is dismissed.

